    {
      "stableId": "math3-1988-q18",
      "sourceYear": 1988,
      "subjectCode": "math3",
      "type": "solution",
      "questionNumber": 18,
      "stem": "设 f (x ) 在 $( - \\infty + \\infty )$ 上有连续导数，且 $m \\leqslant f ( x ) \\leqslant M$ \n\n(Ⅰ) 求 $\\operatorname* { l i m } _ { a \\to + 0 } { \\frac { 1 } { 4 a ^ { 2 } } } \\int _ { - a } ^ { a } [ f ( t + a ) - f ( t - a ) ] \\mathrm { d } t .$ \n\n(Ⅱ) 证明 $\\left| { \\frac { 1 } { 2 a } } \\int _ { - a } ^ { a } f ( t ) \\mathrm { d } t - f ( x ) \\right| \\leqslant M - m ( a > 0 )$ −",
      "options": [],
      "answer": null,
      "answerStatus": "missing",
      "explanation": "解. (Ⅰ)可以用积分中值定理和微分中值定理．这里用洛必达法则直接计算：\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\text {原式} = \\lim _ {a \\rightarrow + 0} \\frac {1}{4 a ^ {2}} \\left[ \\int_ {0} ^ {2 a} f (u) \\mathrm{d} u - \\int_ {- 2 a} ^ {0} f (u) \\mathrm{d} u \\right] \\\\ = \\lim _ {a \\rightarrow + 0} \\frac {1}{8 a} [ 2 f (2 a) - 2 f (- 2 a) ] = \\lim _ {a \\rightarrow + 0} \\frac {1}{4 a} [ f (2 a) - f (- 2 a) ] \\\\ = \\lim _ {a \\to + 0} \\frac {1}{4} \\left[ 2 f ^ {\\prime} (2 a) + 2 f ^ {\\prime} (- 2 a) \\right] = f ^ {\\prime} (0). \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\n\n(Ⅱ)可以分别估计两项．这里利用积分的绝对值不等式来估计：\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\left| \\frac {1}{2 a} \\int_ {- a} ^ {a} f (t) \\mathrm{d} t - f (x) \\right| = \\left| \\frac {1}{2 a} \\int_ {- a} ^ {a} [ f (t) - f (x) ] \\mathrm{d} t \\right| \\\\ \\leqslant \\frac {1}{2 a} \\int_ {- a} ^ {a} | f (t) - f (x) | \\mathrm{d} t \\leqslant \\frac {1}{2 a} \\int_ {- a} ^ {a} (M - m) \\mathrm{d} t = M - m \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$",
